```

## Type

type
```agda
insertSorted : ℕ → List ℕ → List ℕ
```

## Term

```agda
insertSorted n [] = []
insertSorted n (x ∷ xs) = insertSorted n xs ++ (x ∷ insertSorted n xs)
```

